sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant O as Orchestrator
  participant S as Model (vLLM)
  participant T as Tool sandbox
  U->>O: Task (via gateway, SSE open)
  O->>S: Reasoning call (step 1)
  S-->>O: Tool call request
  O->>T: Execute tool (sandboxed)
  T-->>O: Result (validated)
  O->>S: Reasoning call (step 2, with result)
  S-->>O: Final answer
  O-->>U: Streamed answer + citations
  O->>O: Checkpoint run state
